function renderBlogDetails() {
  return `${breadcrumb('How to build a better Indian pantry', 'Blog')}<main><article class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto px-4 py-8 md:px-8 md:py-12"><header class="text-center"><p class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-dark">PANTRY GUIDE · AUGUST 14, 2026</p><h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-balance md:text-6xl">How to build an Indian pantry that works every day</h1><p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-neutral-600 text-pretty">A practical guide to versatile grains, spices, lentils, and shortcuts that make weeknight cooking easier.</p><p class="mt-5 text-sm font-semibold">By the Quicklly Editorial Team</p></header><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596040033229-a9821ebd058d?auto=format&fit=crop&q=82&w=1400" alt="Colorful whole spices arranged in bowls" class="mt-10 aspect-[16/9] w-full object-cover"><div class="prose prose-neutral mx-auto mt-10 max-w-[720px]"><p class="text-lg leading-8 text-neutral-700">A useful pantry is less about collecting every ingredient and more about choosing a small group that can move across meals. Start with what you actually cook, then add depth one region at a time.</p><h2 class="mt-10 text-3xl font-semibold">Begin with a dependable base</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-neutral-700">Basmati rice, atta, two lentils, neutral oil, and a handful of whole and ground spices cover an enormous range of dishes. Buy sizes that match your household so freshness never becomes an afterthought.</p><h2 class="mt-10 text-3xl font-semibold">Let shortcuts earn their shelf space</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-neutral-700">A ready masala or frozen bread is valuable when it makes a real dinner possible. Look for products that remove repetition without replacing the flavor you care about.</p><blockquote class="mt-10 border-l-4 border-brand-green bg-neutral-50 p-6 text-xl font-semibold text-pretty">The best pantry is the one that helps you cook on the busiest night of the week.</blockquote></div><div class="mx-auto mt-10 flex max-w-[720px] flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-y border-neutral-200 py-5"><span class="text-sm font-semibold">Share this guide</span><div class="flex gap-2">${['Copy link','Email','Facebook'].map(label => button(label, `data-share-article="${label}"`, true)).join('')}</div></div><section class="mt-14"><h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold">Shop the pantry</h2><div class="mt-6">${productGrid(3)}</div></section><section class="mt-14"><div class="flex items-end justify-between"><h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold">Related stories</h2><a href="blog.html" class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-dark">Back to Blog</a></div><div class="mt-6 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2"><a href="blog-details.html" class="border border-neutral-200 p-6"><p class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-dark">GUIDE</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold">Five weeknight dals worth knowing</h3></a><a href="blog-details.html" class="border border-neutral-200 p-6"><p class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-dark">RECIPES</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold">A smarter way to plan a festive menu</h3></a></div></section></article></main>`;
}

